CHAPTER.VERS:
And he said to them, Which of you

          {+}
         will have a son or an ox fallen into a well, and will not immediately draw him up on a Sabbath day?

For I say to you

          {+}
        , that none of those men who were invited will taste of my supper.

For which of you

          {+}
        , desiring to build a tower, does not first sit down and count the cost, whether he has [the means] to complete it?

So therefore whoever he is of you

          {+}
         who does not renounce all that he has, he can't be my disciple.
